# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0
# Applies when building enterprise/comms/app/deploy/Dockerfile with the repo
# root as context (`docker build -f enterprise/comms/app/deploy/Dockerfile .`).
# Keep the build context to what the image actually COPYs — everything else
# (the whole rest of the monorepo: crates/, os/, apps/, other enterprise/
# subtrees, .git, target/, node_modules/) is irrelevant to this image and
# would only slow the build / bloat the context.
*

!enterprise/features/**
!enterprise/comms/app/**
!enterprise/comms/compliance/**

# Never let build artifacts, secrets, or compiled crate output from sibling
# submodules ride along even though they're nested under the paths above.
enterprise/comms/app/core-rs/target/
enterprise/comms/app/verification/verify-rs/target/
enterprise/comms/app/persistence/seal-rs/target/
enterprise/comms/app/persistence/seal-wasm/target/
**/*.env
**/secrets/
